  "identity": "Hovering independent reliquary lord shaped like a squat ornate oak coffin coffer in aged brass armor. Hooded ivory death-mask face above a huge brass keyhole breastplate, two short chain arms with mittenlike bone knuckles, ragged violet cloth skirts hanging below. A bulging leather tax satchel and a tiny crooked crown emphasize pompous authority. Distinct from staff-carrying marshal.",
